<title>USA: Phoenix retains new auditor, advisors.</title>
<headline>Phoenix retains new auditor, advisors.</headline>
<dateline>ST. PETERSBURG, Fla. 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Phoenix Information Systems Corp said on Wednesday it retained new auditors and financial advisors for guidance in structuring the company's capitalization for future growth.</p>
<p>Phoenix hired BDO Seidman LLP as its auditor and Benedetto, Gartland &amp; Greene and Credit Research and Trading LLC as financial advisors.</p>
<p>The company also hired KCSA Public Relations as its investor relations counsel.</p>
<p>Phoenix provides information systems and services for the travel and tourism industry.</p>
